A City on the Brink

Dredgeport is spiralling out of control. Gangs rule the slums, corruption trumps the law, and corpses of the war-dead are burned daily for fuel. You are an ex-soldier, mistaken for dead and shipped back to Dredgeport for processing. After a narrow escape, you find yourself alone in the guts of the city, with only two things to your name: your life and your sanity. Keeping both will prove a challenge.&nbsp;

Choose Your Course&nbsp;

Inspired by tabletop RPGs and narrative adventure games like Citizen Sleeper, Duskpunk finds a balance between challenge and freedom, tracking your health, energy and stress as you try to survive. Make lasting choices that determine the city’s fate. Develop skills to distinguish yourself in your chosen field of work. Earn a crust, explore the city, make alliances and escape your traumatic past.&nbsp;

Friends and Foes

&nbsp;

Dredgeport plays host to characters with rich backstories and murky motivations. Some care for you or the city; others are in it for themselves, but will pay well. Choose your allies wisely. They will be part of your fate whether you like it or not.

When you close your eyes, you can see it. You’ve dreamt about it for as long as you’ve known it existed: Diamond Straits, that island paradise where fantasy becomes reality, and where the fantastical collection of beautiful, exotic animal-human hybrid women serve your every desire.

You may never afford a trip there; you may never don a mask and have your thirsts quenched, but that doesn’t mean you can’t experience luxury from an entirely different angle.

Welcome to your new career.

IN HEAT: Lustful Nights puts you in the role of a newly recruited Security Guard on the tropical paradise of Diamond Straits, a haven for the rich and the degenerate to enjoy the island’s exclusive and revolutionary anthropomorphic entertainers.

The game contains three distinct modes, each with their own hurdles to overcome and mechanics to master as you try your best to keep your job, and your body, intact.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Security Office

Your first job in the company is in the Security Office: a rundown part of the island where the girls cause all sorts of trouble while you try to keep things running.

Mind your doors and sanity, perform plenty of microgames, keep the girls at bay, and keep yourself employed.

Survive those nights and you’ll earn your promotion to the second gamemode:

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Nightclub

In the Nightclub, manage the girls’ excitement while partnering them with customers to maximize your score.

Keep an eye on customer preferences and patience, close the doors on girls that think you’re the best solution to their desperation, and keep operations running smoothly until the night ends.

Prove yourself a valuable asset and you might just be chosen for something more experimental.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Arcade

The Arcade brings you into a virtual world, offering a dynamic, ever-changing challenge that pits you and your wits against a variety of different characters all with their own behaviors and mechanics that you must learn and master.

Use all of your abilities and resources to keep the simulations at bay, and unlock Custom Night to craft your own personalized challenges to really push yourself to your limit.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Also...

Experience a whole range of animated scenes with each girl, and replay them as much as you like with the free-cam gallery.

Go on VN-style dates to learn more about the personalities behind the sex appeal.

And earn tokens every time you play, and use them in the Gachapon machine to unlock extra scenes for the video gallery as well as gifts to win over the girls’ affections.

There’s plenty to discover within Diamond Straits, and more is being added with each update.

The only questions are how deep will you delve into its secrets, and how long will you last if you do?

Happy Hunting.

Being a DIK - Season 3 requires the base game Being a DIK - Season 1 and the Being a DIK - Season 2 DLC in order to play. Being a DIK - Season 3 utilizes save files made at the end of episode 8 (Being a DIK - Season 2) to play.

&nbsp;

About this content

The third season of Being a DIK picks up where the previous season ended, answering big questions and asking new ones.

&nbsp;

Choices matter

The branching storyline will have you replay the season repeatedly to experience all the content. The story is meticulously tailored to your past Seasons 1 and 2 choices. In this game, choices truly matter.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Continue your story, deepen your relationships, and experience more songs, mini-games, and girls in this highly anticipated installment.

&nbsp;

Being a DIK - Season 3 is even bigger than previous seasons and includes "Interlude - Riding the Waves" and Episodes 9-12.

&nbsp;

Interlude - Riding the Waves

&nbsp;

What happened before you came to B&R? Delve deeper into your character's past by controlling Zoey and experiencing her side of the story.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Episode 9 - Vixens

&nbsp;

When the DIKs are throwing a big Halloween party, you're left to deal with the problems that arise. As people come together to party, friendships and relationships are tested.

&nbsp;

Episode 10 - Calm Before the Snow

&nbsp;

Classes have reconvened, and the DIKs are dealing with the aftermath of the Halloween party. As Thanksgiving closes, a big plan is set into motion.

&nbsp;

Episode 11 - Paradigm Shift

&nbsp;

Winter has come. A fight breaks out and you're left wondering who you can trust. While some grow closer than before, others may never return to what they once were.

Episode 12 - Smoke and Fire

&nbsp;

The year comes to an end, as does your first semester at B&R. The choices you have made, the divergent road you wander... Will you look at your journey the same after you have peered beneath the surface?

&nbsp;

Being a DIK: Season 4 will be the final season that concludes the story.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages or may not be appropriate for viewing at work.

