Espiocracy will see you manage operations, budgets, and staff across a variety of nations with different geopolitical and socioeconomic circumstances. Work in service of a fledgling nation, a superpower, or an independence movement, using unique capabilities, diverse tactics, and ruthless cunning to overcome adversity in a time of great technological and political change.

